  1998                          ;
  1999                          ;
  2000                          ;OSKEY - Read key with time-limit, test for ESCape.
  2001                          ;Main function is carried out in user patch.
  2002                          ;   Inputs: HL = time limit (centiseconds)
  2003                          ;  Outputs: Carry reset if time-out
  2004                          ;           If carry set A = character
  2005                          ; Destroys: A,H,L,F
  2006                          ;
  2007  0746  e5                OSKEY:	PUSH	HL
  2008  0747  210a08            	LD	HL,INKEY
